##   │ ├ Pager                                               {{{3
# The pager sits centre-screen and never moves. Navigating raises it above
# everything; Schedule 9901 drops it back to the bottom layer.
#
# $0 $1 = GotoPage x y args (absolute, or relative with a trailing 'p')
DestroyFunc PagerNavigate
AddToFunc PagerNavigate
+ I Schedule Cancel 9901
+ I GotoPage wrapx wrapy $0 $1
+ I All (FvwmPager) Layer 0 $[infostore.abovetoplayer]
+ I Schedule $[infostore.pager_flash_ms] 9901 PagerPark

# Step $0 pages in reading order, carrying across rows. GotoPage's wrapx/wrapy
# only wrap within a row/column, so the row carry is done in the shell.
DestroyFunc PagerNavigateSeq
AddToFunc PagerNavigateSeq
+ I PipeRead "n=$$(( $[desk.pagesx] * $[desk.pagesy] )); i=$$(( ($[page.nx] + $[page.ny] * $[desk.pagesx] + ($0) + n) % n )); echo PagerNavigate $$(( i % $[desk.pagesx] )) $$(( i / $[desk.pagesx] ))"

DestroyFunc PagerPark
AddToFunc PagerPark
+ I All (FvwmPager) Layer 0 $[infostore.bottomlayer]
